<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>1978 Death Files | Matrix Reprogrammed</title><meta name="description" content="High-profile deaths and living evidence dossiers for 1978."/><meta property="og:title" content="1978 Death Files | Matrix Reprogrammed"/><meta property="og:description" content="High-profile deaths and living evidence dossiers for 1978."/><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="fixes.css"/></head><body><canvas id="matrix"></canvas><div class="signal-face"></div><div class="veil"></div><div class="page"><header class="wrap topbar"><a class="brand" href="index.html"><img src="sigil.png" alt="Matrix Reprogrammed sigil" decoding="async" /> MATRIX REPROGRAMMED</a><nav class="nav"><a href="index.html">Home</a><a href="death-files.html">Death Files</a><a href="investigation-machine.html">Investigations</a><a href="epstein-files.html">Epstein</a><a href="tracker-dashboard.html">Trackers</a><a href="source-document-vault.html">Sources</a><a href="forum.html">Signal Boards</a><a href="search.html">Search</a></nav></header><main><section class="hero wrap death-year-hero"><div class="eyebrow">The Death Files · Year Archive</div><h1>1978</h1><p class="lead">The people, official accounts, evidence trails, consequences, and unanswered questions that remain attached to this year.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="death-files.html#year-archive">All Years</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-files-pattern-lab.html">Pattern Lab</a></div></section><section class="section wrap"><h2>Dossiers</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="aldo-moro"><span class="label">1978 · Political leader · Kidnapping</span><h3>Aldo Moro</h3><p>Moro was central to the proposed Historic Compromise between Christian Democrats and the Italian Communist Party during intense Cold War conflict. Moro&#39;s death ended the immediate path toward the Historic Compromise and deepened Italy&#39;s Years of Lead.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>9 May 1978</span><span>Rome, Italy</span><span>Homicide</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-aldo-moro.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-aldo-moro.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="georgi-markov"><span class="label">1978 · Dissident · Poisoning</span><h3>Georgi Markov</h3><p>Markov used Western broadcasts to expose the Bulgarian communist leadership and its inner workings. The case became a defining example of covert assassination technology.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>11 Sept 1978</span><span>London, United Kingdom</span><span>Homicide and state assassination</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-georgi-markov.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-georgi-markov.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="john-paisley"><span class="label">1978 · Intelligence officer · Disputed suicide</span><h3>John Paisley</h3><p>Paisley had worked on Soviet nuclear intelligence and was involved in sensitive internal CIA disputes before leaving the agency. His death fed lasting suspicion around Cold War counterintelligence and internal CIA accountability.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>24 Sept 1978</span><span>Chesapeake Bay, Maryland, United States</span><span>Suicide in official ruling</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-john-paisley.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-john-paisley.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="harvey-milk"><span class="label">1978 · Political leader · Civil rights</span><h3>Harvey Milk</h3><p>Milk was advancing gay civil rights and coalition politics during a national backlash over equality legislation. The killings reshaped San Francisco politics and galvanised the modern gay-rights movement.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>27 Nov 1978</span><span>San Francisco, California, United States</span><span>Homicide</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-harvey-milk.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-harvey-milk.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article></div></section><section class="section wrap"><h2>Year Pattern Boundary</h2><article class="card"><p>Shared dates, institutions, investigators, lawyers, beneficiaries, or security failures are leads for comparison. A pattern does not establish coordination.</p></article></section><script type="application/json" id="compatibility-marker-vault" data-cleanup-marker="deep-cleanup">{"status":"compatibility-routes-preserved-with-clean-public-copy","checked":"2026-08-03","routes":["downloads/forum-posts.json","downloads/forum-posts.md","feed-center.html","share-center.html","launch-room.html","offer-center.html","source-document-vault.html","evidence-vault.html","black-file.html"]}</script></main><footer class="footer wrap"><p><strong>THE DEATH FILES</strong> — evidence first, conclusion second.</p><p class="warning">Inclusion does not imply murder, conspiracy, or wrongdoing by any connected person. Official findings, established evidence, disputed claims, analytical inference, and speculation are displayed separately.</p></footer></div><script src="matrix.js"></script><script src="death-files.js"></script></body></html>